   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Suspected ischemic heart disease: WHICH TEST? Match it to the PRETEST PROBABILITY and the QUESTION",
   "lines": [
    "history + exam are the most important tests · pretest probability: age, male sex, the type of chest pain, risk factors",
    "a NORMAL ECG does NOT exclude ischemia · chest pain is the LAST step of the ischemic cascade, after perfusion, wall motion and ECG change"
   ]
  },
